ized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5512506924","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123088#issuecomment-5512506924","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123088","id":5512506924,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSJIuLA","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-02T16:02:40Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T16:02:40Z","body":"The reason this change adds bloat is because it's adding a ton of duplicated code copied from ResourceImporterTexture. Most of these functions take an Image object, which is the same both for streaming and non-streaming textures.\r\n\r\nmy question is why can't we inherit from ResourceImporterTexture, or make a helper file that handles all of the Image operations.\r\n\r\nif we can share all of the code, it would not be necessary to single out hdr or other features to disable.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5512506924/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":